{
  "id": "583501",
  "resourceId": 835,
  "name": "明日香：WILLE",
  "skin": "最終決戰:明日香",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c835_01_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c835_01_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "幹嘛？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "沒想到我會真的穿禮服？也是吧。\n不管是這邊還是在那邊，一直都在備戰狀態。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "那個靠關係的四眼田雞……這種時候就給我玩消失……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "靠關係的四眼田雞怎麼會在樂隊裡？煩死了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "我的外貌？這是EVA的詛咒……和你沒關係。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "喂，別擺出大驚小怪的臉呀！我可是精英，會樂器也是理所當然吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "別把我當小孩。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "靠關係的四眼田雞……\n真虧她能那麼悠然。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "這裡奇怪的傢伙也不少嘛，像你一樣的lilin反而很少見呢。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "lilin，妮姬……\n嘛，你們一樣喜歡音樂吧？那就夠了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "只要你還在戰鬥，我和2號機就會幫助你。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "作為lilin的時候，我也有練過樂器。\n你問為什麼？……我也不知道",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "無聊。不過，和平的日常感覺也不錯。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "頭髮……還在長。算了，配這衣服也剛好。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "下次給我帶台遊戲機來。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "累了？剛好，我也不喜歡湊熱鬧。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "給我準備個遠點的屋子。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "想在這辦宴會嗎？\n把這裡打理得像樣點吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "明白了，這也是我要保護的地方。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "是嘛，這裡才是你最舒服的家……我明白了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "lilin，不給這裡多準備點防禦設施嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "在這裡還自在點，有機會的話……\n算了，當我沒說。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "沒錯，我還是明日香。打起來就躲我後面吧，lilin。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "雖然說是你邀請的宴會，可是……\n這種衣服還是第一次穿。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "這是理所當然的吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "更換新的裝備。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "2號機，聽到了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "妮姬不管打扮成什麼樣子都能戰鬥，對吧？\n那我也一樣。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "正好！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "應急的準備做到極限。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "哦，謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "還沒謝幕，別急著送禮。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "哼，還在討我高興？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "再說一遍，我可不是什么明星，別搞錯哦。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "勉為其難收下吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "宴會不錯，你的禮物也不錯。\n謝謝。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "能幫我剪下頭髮嗎？只有頭髮還在長，真麻煩。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "喂，等等，你在客氣什麼啊？\n我又不是什麼偶像。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "你負責管理這麼多麻煩傢伙嗎？也是夠辛苦了。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "我的笑容變多了？\n才沒有這回事。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "嚇我一跳！\n幹嘛呀！\n笨蛋嗎你？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "我已經習慣這裡了，你不用躲著我。\n對，這是當然的吧？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "靠關係的四眼田雞呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "我不會在意這些的！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "你是笨蛋嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "什麼時候能回去把衣服換了？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "了解……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "真是的，這身衣服有夠礙事。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "來得正好。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "了解，緊急接敵！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "出戰確認。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "快點搞定吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "該上了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "早就開始了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "掩護我！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "啧，偏偏是這時候。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "別催！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "子彈打空了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "在換彈！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "這邊怎麼是樂器……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "還在換彈！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "給我彈匣。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "2號機！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "莽撞點上吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "我們上吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "EVA2號機，啟動！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "嘿誒——！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "現在正是樂章的高潮！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "別擋路——！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "簡單。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "礙事！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "弱。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "下一個！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "真煩人！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "啧……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "哼——",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "糟透了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "被攻擊了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "疼……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "作弊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "掩護射擊，一直都很慢！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "切，淨耍陰招。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "任務完成，回去吧，lilin。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "連緊急訓練都算不上嘛。\nlilin，回去了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}